  "title": "Markov blanket",
  "statements": [
    {
      "id": "a84758f5-c0f7-41d6-8bf9-39cf8622cc25",
      "text": "A Markov blanket is the set of states that makes the internal states of a system conditionally independent of its external states. It marks the boundary of a thing in a statistical sense, not necessarily a physical membrane.",
